3. Modified / derived files (Apache-2.0 section 4(b) change notice)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
The following files were changed from, or generated from, the sources above.
They combine material from both projects, so both licenses apply.

  turtlebot4_standard/turtlebot4_standard.urdf
  turtlebot4_lite/turtlebot4_lite.urdf
      Generated by flattening turtlebot4_description/urdf/{standard,lite}/
      turtlebot4.urdf.xacro, which includes
      irobot_create_description/urdf/create3.urdf.xacro, with xacro 2.1.1
      (argument gazebo:=ignition). Changes made:
        - all xacro macros, properties and includes expanded into one file;
        - mesh URIs rewritten from package://turtlebot4_description/meshes/...
          and package://irobot_create_description/meshes/... to paths
          relative to the URDF (meshes/<file>.dae);
        - a change-notice comment added at the top of the file.

  turtlebot4_standard/usd/   (all files)
  turtlebot4_lite/usd/       (all files)
      Generated from the URDFs above by the Isaac Sim 6.1 URDF importer
      (scripts/import_turtlebot4_urdf.py, scripts/import_turtlebot4_lite_urdf.py).
      Joint drive parameters were overridden, and the wheel-drop joints'
      newton:velocityLimit was changed from 0 to inf, as documented in
      PROGRESS.md (2026-09-17 entries).

Changes made in 2026-09 for simulation testing in this repository.


